            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Una as duas listas e salve o resultado na variável <code>all_scores</code> para uso posterior.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"team_1 = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Ana&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"78\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Joe&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"80\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"team_2 = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Kim&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"57\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Sam&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"60\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"all_scores = team_1 + team_2\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(all_scores)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"65\" endIndex=\"75\" /><option startIndex=\"76\" endIndex=\"77\" /><option startIndex=\"78\" endIndex=\"93\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"['Ana', 78, 'Joe', 80, 'Kim', 57, 'Sam', 60]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>all_scores</code> seguido de <code>=</code> e finalmente <code>team_1 + team_2</code>.</p></body></html>",
